%% State machine — Estados de uma lesson na perspectiva do user
%% Spec: Docs/specs/biblioteca-spec-1.md RF-05 + RF-06 + RF-07 + D7 + D12
%% Refs: ADR-073 (entitlements), ADR-074 (progress sync)
%%
%% Estados ortogonais combinam acesso (locked/previewable/accessible) com
%% engajamento (in_progress/completed). Maquina simplificada para clarity.

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> locked: lesson criada<br/>isPublished=false

    locked --> previewable: founder marca isPublished=true<br/>(SQL UPDATE — sem UI MVP)
    note right of locked
        User NAO ve a lesson
        no /biblioteca.
        Founder usa para preparar
        conteudo antes de publicar.
    end note

    previewable --> accessible: admin grant via<br/>POST /api/admin/library/grant-access<br/>(insert user_lesson_access)
    note right of previewable
        User ve capa em /biblioteca
        (catalogo aspiracional D7).
        CTA "Em breve" cinza,
        cursor not-allowed.
        Click = log evento
        access_blocked.
    end note

    accessible --> in_progress: user assiste/le primeiro segundo<br/>PATCH /lessons/:id/progress<br/>(lastPositionSeconds > 0)
    note right of accessible
        User pode abrir viewer.
        Tabs renderizam apenas
        formatos disponiveis.
        Sem progresso ainda.
        Default tab = video > podcast > article.
    end note

    in_progress --> in_progress: continua consumindo<br/>(throttle 15s client + 5s server)
    note left of in_progress
        Cross-format sync por
        SEGUNDOS absolutos (ADR-074).
        Trocar tab podcast→video:
        startPos = oldPos se cabe
        em newTotalDur, senao 0.
    end note

    in_progress --> completed: lastPositionSeconds >=<br/>totalDurationSeconds * 0.95<br/>(D12 — UPDATE completedAt=NOW)
    note right of completed
        Marcador para refund job
        (Spec 4 — < 25% consumido
        em janela 7d = elegivel).
    end note

    completed --> in_progress: user re-consome<br/>(seek inicial ou novo formato)<br/>completedAt PRESERVADO

    accessible --> revoked: admin DELETE row<br/>OU expiresAt < NOW (subscription)
    in_progress --> revoked: idem
    completed --> revoked: idem

    revoked --> previewable: re-grant<br/>(novo INSERT user_lesson_access)
    note left of revoked
        Soft-delete via DELETE row
        ou expiresAt expirado.
        Progress permanece em
        library_progress (audit).
    end note

    previewable --> locked: founder marca isPublished=false<br/>(reverso, esconde do catalogo)

    completed --> [*]: lesson hard-delete<br/>(CASCADE limpa<br/>access + events + progress)
